    "custom_liquid_cqKTNy": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"jlr-reviews-section\">\n  <h2 class=\"jlr-heading\">\n    Loved by <span class=\"jlr-highlight\">100,000+</span>\n  </h2>\n\n  \n\n  <div class=\"jlr-grid\">\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Rana, 38</span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"I had gotten to the point where I dreaded getting dressed. Constant bloating, nothing fit, and trying harder only made me feel worse. A few weeks in, I feel lighter and so much calmer.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Lara, 46</span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"I was so tired of feeling ashamed of a body I was working so hard for. Now I finally feel like myself again, and my cravings don't run my evenings anymore.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Nadine, 41</span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"The bloating alone made me miserable. I eat clean and work out, but by night I felt so swollen. The bloating eased first, then my clothes started fitting better.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"jlr-card\">\n      <div class=\"jlr-header\">\n        <span class=\"jlr-name\">Maya, 52</span>\n        <span class=\"jlr-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"jlr-text\">\n        \"I feel like a layer of stress came off me. My energy is steadier, my mood is lighter, and I feel comfortable in my body again.\"\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .jlr-reviews-section {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    padding: 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    width: 100%;\n    max-width: 100vw;\n    overflow-x: hidden;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-reviews-section * {\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-heading {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 32px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0 0 14px 0;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-highlight {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8739c, #f7b8cf);\n    color: #fff;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-disclaimer {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.4;\n    color: #555;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 0 auto 24px auto;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    gap: 16px;\n    max-width: 1400px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    width: 100%;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-card {\n    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #fde3ec 0%, #ffffff 100%);\n    border: 1px solid #f7cfdd;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 20px;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 8px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-name {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-stars {\n    color: #e0608e;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n\n  .jlr-text {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0;\n    overflow-wrap: break-word;\n    word-break: break-word;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .jlr-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .jlr-heading {\n      font-size: 22px;\n      margin-bottom: 10px;\n    }\n\n    .jlr-disclaimer {\n      font-size: 11.5px;\n      margin-bottom: 18px;\n    }\n\n    .jlr-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .jlr-card {\n      padding: 16px;\n    }\n\n    .jlr-name {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .jlr-text {\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
