        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"fade-section\">\n  <div class=\"fade-image\">\n    <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/2981/1738/files/bloomin-natural-glp-1-gummies-2786923.webp?v=1793546331\" alt=\"Bloomin hormonal support gummies with shatavari, saffron and shilajit\" loading=\"lazy\">\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"fade-content\">\n    <h2 class=\"fade-heading\">\n      Made To Help You Feel <span class=\"highlight\">Calm, Energized &amp; Back In Control</span>\n    </h2>\n\n    <p class=\"fade-text\">\n      Meet the one-a-day gummy made for women whose bodies started changing along with their hormones.\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"fade-text\">\n      When your hormones shift, stress, cravings and energy dips tend to hit all at once, and willpower alone stops working. Bloomin pairs shatavari, the Ayurvedic herb traditionally used for women's hormonal health, with saffron and shilajit. Together they support your mood, steady your energy and help quiet the cravings that keep pulling you off track.\n    </p>\n\n    <p class=\"fade-text\">\n      It's free of hormones and stimulants, so there are no jitters and no crash. Just one gummy a day that helps you feel like yourself again.\n    </p>\n\n    <div class=\"fade-highlights\">\n      <div class=\"highlight-item\">\n        <span class=\"sparkle\">✦</span>\n        <span>Calmer mood &amp; fewer cravings</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"highlight-item\">\n        <span class=\"sparkle\">✦</span>\n        <span>Hormone-free &amp; stimulant-free</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .fade-section {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: stretch;\n    gap: 40px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    border-top: 3px solid #f7b8cf;\n    padding-top: 20px;\n  }\n\n  .fade-image {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n  }\n\n  .fade-image img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: 100%;\n    object-fit: cover;\n    display: block;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .fade-content {\n    flex: 1;\n    min-width: 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: center;\n    padding: 20px 0;\n  }\n\n  .fade-heading {\n    font-size: 26px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 0 0 20px 0;\n  }\n\n  .highlight {\n    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f7b8cf 0%, #fde3ec 55%, #ffffff 100%);\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    padding: 2px 8px;\n    box-decoration-break: clone;\n    -webkit-box-decoration-break: clone;\n  }\n\n  .fade-text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    margin: 0 0 16px 0;\n  }\n\n  .fade-highlights {\n    display: flex;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 24px;\n    margin-top: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .highlight-item {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 8px;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .sparkle {\n    color: #e0608e;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    flex-shrink: 0;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 768px) {\n    .fade-section {\n      flex-direction: column;\n      gap: 20px;\n    }\n\n    .fade-heading {\n      font-size: 19px;\n      margin-bottom: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .fade-text {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      margin-bottom: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .fade-highlights {\n      gap: 14px;\n    }\n\n    .highlight-item {\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n    }\n\n    .fade-content {\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
