    "custom_liquid_9AGPLc": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "disabled": true,
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<div class=\"reviews-mixed-section\">\n  <div class=\"reviews-summary\">\n    <span name=\"rt-stars\" class=\"rt-stars\">★★★★★</span>\n    <span class=\"rt-summary-text\">4.8/5 based on <strong>500+ reviews</strong></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"reviews-mixed-grid\">\n    <div class=\"rm-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/2981/1738/files/POLQGXIReM.jpg?v=1786825467\" alt=\"Customer result photo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"rm-body\">\n        <div class=\"rm-header\">\n          <span class=\"rm-name\">Sarah T.</span>\n          <span class=\"rm-verified\">✓ Verified</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rm-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"rm-text\">I love this mask! It brightens my skin and I can already see my spots fading — my pores look smaller too.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rm-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/2981/1738/files/fHp_IdQlP9.jpg?v=1786825467\" alt=\"Customer result photo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"rm-body\">\n        <div class=\"rm-header\">\n          <span class=\"rm-name\">Layal K.</span>\n          <span class=\"rm-verified\">✓ Verified</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rm-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"rm-text\">Authentic and works exactly as described. I have sensitive skin and it didn't break me out — it actually calmed things down.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rm-card\">\n      <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0957/2981/1738/files/EbqVZVXNKo.jpg?v=1786825467\" alt=\"Customer result photo\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"rm-body\">\n        <div class=\"rm-header\">\n          <span class=\"rm-name\">Rania M.</span>\n          <span class=\"rm-verified\">✓ Verified</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rm-stars\">★★★★☆</div>\n        <p class=\"rm-text\">The glow up is real. My skin felt more plump and hydrated by morning, and my fine lines were barely noticeable.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rm-card rm-card-noimg\">\n      <div class=\"rm-body\">\n        <div class=\"rm-header\">\n          <span class=\"rm-name\">Nour A.</span>\n          <span class=\"rm-verified\">✓ Verified</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rm-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"rm-text\">I wore this as an overnight mask and woke up with my face noticeably brighter and more hydrated. So far anyone with sensitive skin or dullness, I'd recommend it.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rm-card rm-card-noimg\">\n      <div class=\"rm-body\">\n        <div class=\"rm-header\">\n          <span class=\"rm-name\">Maya H.</span>\n          <span class=\"rm-verified\">✓ Verified</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rm-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"rm-text\">Such a lifesaver! My skin has gotten noticeably brighter and so much clearer. I had a bit of doubt but I'm so glad I tried it.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rm-card rm-card-noimg\">\n      <div class=\"rm-body\">\n        <div class=\"rm-header\">\n          <span class=\"rm-name\">Dana F.</span>\n          <span class=\"rm-verified\">✓ Verified</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rm-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"rm-text\">I've tried so many products for my dark spots and this is the first one where I actually saw a difference within weeks.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"rm-card rm-card-noimg\">\n      <div class=\"rm-body\">\n        <div class=\"rm-header\">\n          <span class=\"rm-name\">Yasmine C.</span>\n          <span class=\"rm-verified\">✓ Verified</span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"rm-stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p class=\"rm-text\">One nightly step and I already notice my tone looking more even. Simple routine, real results.</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .reviews-mixed-section {\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    max-width: 1400px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 20px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .reviews-summary {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 10px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-bottom: 24px;\n  }\n\n  .rt-stars {\n    color: #e0a83e;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .rt-summary-text {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .reviews-mixed-grid {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);\n    gap: 16px;\n  }\n\n  .rm-card {\n    background: #fff;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    border: 1px solid #eee;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n  }\n\n  .rm-card-noimg {\n    background: #f5f5f4;\n    border: none;\n  }\n\n  .rm-card img {\n    width: 100%;\n    display: block;\n    aspect-ratio: 4/3;\n    object-fit: cover;\n  }\n\n  .rm-body {\n    padding: 14px 16px;\n    flex: 1;\n  }\n\n  .rm-header {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n  }\n\n  .rm-name {\n    font-size: 14px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .rm-verified {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    color: #4a90d9;\n  }\n\n  .rm-stars {\n    color: #e0a83e;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n\n  .rm-text {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n    color: #333;\n    margin: 0;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 900px) {\n    .reviews-mixed-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n    }\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width: 480px) {\n    .reviews-mixed-grid {\n      grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n\n    .rm-name {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n\n    .rm-text {\n      font-size: 12.5px;\n    }\n\n    .rt-summary-text {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
